  unitName: Platinum Nekky
  unitId: 50234
  unitNumber: 253
  description: Rumored to live somewhere in Grand Gaia on an island called "Famitsu
    Island," Nekky was greeted by some Metal Ghosts who had gotten lost and found
    their way to him. Impressed by how charming he was, the Metal Ghosts began training
    with Nekky. Once the intense training had finished, Nekky stood anew, glistening
    with white light. *Nekky is the mascot for Famitsu, Japan's No. 1 game media
    outlet.
  summonDesc: How do I appear to you?<br>Anyway, feel free to <br>use me as you like!
  fusionDesc: You're giving me more power?<br>Don't worry about me,<br>give some
    power to the others!
